<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">Usage</h2>
    <p>
        The following code example and result shows a button inside a section that has had its padding removed, with the button adding 
        a margin setting of 5 (which equates to 1rem) on the top (block-start) and a margin setting of 3 (which equates to 0.5rem) on its left side (inline-start).
    </p>
    
    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CssClassesSnippets.Margin_Code_Example" AriaLabel="Margin code example." />

    <div class="@Section.Base @Section.Bordered @Section.FixedRadius(UnitRadius.One) @Section.NoPadding">
        <button class="@Button.Base @Button.FixedRadius(UnitRadius.One) @Margin.InlineStart(UnitSpace.Three) @Margin.BlockStart(UnitSpace.Five)">A button inside a section</button>
    </div>
</section>

